  \p{Nested address scheme by area and sub-area, e.g. \code{krn-shp-0012} (kernel/shapes), \code{rt-vdc-0003} (root/vdc), \code{up-lim-0007}, \code{ft-yon-0002}, \code{sp-univ-0001}, \code{tl-lint-0004}, \code{wf-mcp-0001}, \code{dec-0031} (decisions), \code{at-0044} (acceptance tests), \code{ms-0003} (milestones), \code{oq-0012} (open questions); generated declaration nodes \code{lean-<hash8>}. The \ref{ms-0000} porting agent adapts this to forester v5's addressing and records the mapping from the \code{D-}/\code{AT-}/\code{OQ-} IDs used here.}
}
